{"id":"630187","name":"炸腐竹煎蛋汤米粉","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630187/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"炸腐竹","amount":"一小袋"},{"name":"煎蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鲜米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"炸花生","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"十香菜","amount":"可选"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鲜米粉适量。","img":"images/630187/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"什香菜择洗净。个人喜欢这个十（什）香菜，不喜欢的可不加。","img":"images/630187/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炸腐竹。","img":"images/630187/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里适量油烧热，打入两个鸡蛋。","img":"images/630187/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/630187/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盛出切大块。","img":"images/630187/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅留底油，放入姜蒜炒香。","img":"images/630187/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入适量开水。","img":"images/630187/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入鲜米粉。","img":"images/630187/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量盐，生抽，味精调一下味儿。","img":"images/630187/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入炸腐竹。","img":"images/630187/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"勺儿自己做的香辣红油。","img":"images/630187/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"适量花椒酱，煮开。","img":"images/630187/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入煎好的鸡蛋和什香菜。","img":"images/630187/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"搅匀关火。","img":"images/630187/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盛碗，撒上炸好的花生米即可。","img":"images/630187/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/630187/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}